---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Read and change settings

Usage: sbt settings [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  ls     List settings [alias: list]
  get    Print a setting's value
  set    Change a setting
  unset  Reset a setting to its default
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
